<title>JAPAN: Japan Energy yet to set date for topper restart.</title>
<headline>Japan Energy yet to set date for topper restart.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Japan Energy Corp said on Tuesday it was still unclear when the firm would be able to restart the 110,000 barrel-per-day crude distillation unit at its Mizushima plant, which has been shut since a gas leak last week.</p>
<p>&quot;We are still investigating the cause of the accident, and are unable to say when it (the topper) will resume operations,&quot; a Japan Energy spokesman said.</p>
<p>The refiner closed the unit early on December 18 after it detected a hydrogen gas leak from a desulphuriser.</p>
